        "area": "General"
      },
      {
        "type": "GeneralText",
        "content": "<p><strong>DATED MATERIAL, SUBJECT TO CHANGE. PLEASE CONSULT CURRENT UCSD GENERAL CATALOG FOR ANY ADDITIONAL INFORMATION. </strong></p><p><br></p><p>The Music/Humanities major is intended for students who wish to pursue a broad liberal arts program that includes music as a central element. This program emphasizes music history and literature and allows students to select an individual focus for the major within the broad field of the humanities.</p><p><br></p><p>At least three quarters of performance ensembles are required.</p><p><br></p><p>For more information please visit <a href=\"https://music-cms.ucsd.edu/ugrad/index.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://music-cms.ucsd.edu/ugrad/index.html</a></p>",
        "groupId": "4fc46f45-6887-ef11-8474-000d3a37e3b6",
        "position": 1,
        "area": "General"
      },
      {
